<%# Adds the classroom's students to this grade book.

    turbo_frame: "_top" for the same reason the finalize button sets it: this page
    lives inside a turbo frame, but the flash that reports the result is rendered by
    the layout outside that frame, so a frame-scoped response would swallow it.

    Locals:
      label - button text, sentence case
      button_class - the button class to use %>
<%= button_to label,
              populate_classroom_grade_book_path(@classroom, @grade_book),
              class: button_class,
              data: { turbo_frame: "_top" } %>
